    "description": "Complete Postman Collection covering all 9 OpenAPI endpoints for pivot-ms-credit (POST, GET All, GET by ID, GET by Number, GET by Customer, PUT Update/Block/Unblock, GET Balance, PATCH Payment/Consumption & DELETE Soft Delete).",
